Names: IDNA entries, case, trailing dots and length limits (63-byte labels,
253-byte names). {x*N} expands to N copies of x, so
{a*63}.{b*63}.{c*63}.{d*61} is exactly 253 bytes.

-- list n block domains --
bücher.example
MÜNCHEN.example
UPPER.EXAMPLE
trailing.example.
{l*63}.example
{a*63}.{b*63}.{c*63}.{d*61}
{a*63}.{b*63}.{c*63}.{d*62}
{l*64}.example
a..b.example
-- list s block adblock --
||{c*63}.{d*61}^
-- counts n --
rules=6 invalid=3 entries=6
-- counts s --
rules=1 entries=1
-- expect --
xn--bcher-kva.example                    block n xn--bcher-kva.example
xn--mnchen-3ya.example                   block n xn--mnchen-3ya.example
upper.example                            block n upper.example
UPPER.example.                           block n upper.example
trailing.example                         block n trailing.example
trailing.example.                        block n trailing.example
{l*63}.example                           block n {l*63}.example
{a*63}.{b*63}.{c*63}.{d*61}              block n {a*63}.{b*63}.{c*63}.{d*61}
{a*63}.{b*63}.{c*63}.{d*61}.             block n {a*63}.{b*63}.{c*63}.{d*61}
x.{a*63}.{b*63}.{c*63}.{d*61}            block s ||{c*63}.{d*61}^   # over-long query names still walk the suffix set
{a*63}.{b*63}.{c*63}.{d*62}              pass    # the invalid 254-byte entry was not compiled
{l*64}.example                           pass
a..b.example                             pass
{x*300}                                  pass
